{"about_the_game":"NOTE: This is a student project created in an educational setting by senior Game Development students at the Savannah College of Art and Design.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643590/extras/stm_extra_title.png?t=1641324659\" /><br><br>Team up with your friends or go solo to save the city of Jamford from sound-hungry monsters! Keep in touch with the news to find citizens in need of help.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643590/extras/stm_extra_news.png?t=1641324659\" /><br><br>Attack on the beat for stronger hits, and hold to the next beat for a powerful charge attack.<br><br>Choose between four characters, each with their own attack style and role in your team's music.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643590/extras/stm_extra_chrs.png?t=1641324659\" /><br><br>Build new weapons to make new sounds and instruments for your character!<br><br>Explore Jamford, a procedurally generated city with a different layout every time you play!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643590/extras/stm_extra_env.png?t=1641324659\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1643590?t=1641324659","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1641324659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1641324659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1641324659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Share